{"unit_id":"tag:08UJ:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为一个景（site）。令<MATH_0002>为一个同态（homomorphism），在环层（sheaves of rings）之间，定义在<MATH_0003>上。令<MATH_0004>为一个<MATH_0005>-模（module）。令<MATH_0006>。存在一个映射（map），在层（sheaves）之间，其取值为集合（sets），<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>是类（class），对应于映射（map）<MATH_0009>（记号参见证明）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"sheaves of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"给定景，待决"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态","context":"环层同态，待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves of rings","target_term":"环层","context":"同态的对象，待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模，待决"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所寻映射，待决"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"集合层，待决"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"层的取值，待决"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"所给元素的表示，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08UJ:proof","translation":"回忆，给定<MATH_0001>，使得<MATH_0002>是满射的（surjective），其核（kernel）为<MATH_0003>，则复形（complex）<MATH_0004>典范同构于（canonically isomorphic）<MATH_0005>，参见《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。还要注意，<MATH_0006>是层（sheaf），关联于预层（presheaf）<MATH_0007>。换言之，<MATH_0008>是自由的（free）<MATH_0009>-模（module），基于层（sheaf），其取值为集合（sets），<MATH_0010>，特别地，存在一个典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0011>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n说明这些之后，选择某个<MATH_0012>（例如<MATH_0013>，如朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）的定义中所述）。将<MATH_0014>写为类（class），对应于映射（map）<MATH_0015>，其障碍（obstruction）是一个元素（element），属于<MATH_0016>。设它由扩张（extension）<MATH_0017>表示，该扩张由<MATH_0018>-模（modules）组成。考虑层（sheaf），其取值为集合（sets），<MATH_0019>，它带有诱导映射（induced map）<MATH_0020>。令<MATH_0021>和<MATH_0022>。拉回（pullback），作用于<MATH_0023>，通过拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0024>，映到（maps）零，在<MATH_0025>中，因为拉回（pullback），作用于扩张（extension）<MATH_0026>，通过映射（map）<MATH_0027>，是分裂的（split），因为<MATH_0028>是自由的（free）<MATH_0029>-模（module），基于层（sheaf），其取值为集合（sets），<MATH_0030>，并且由构造存在一个交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0031>。这就完成了证明。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"canonically isomorphic","target_term":"典范同构于"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"free","target_term":"自由的"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":