{"unit_id":"tag:08UK:statement","translation":"若存在一个解（solution），针对（<REF_0001>），则集合（set），由解（solutions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）组成，是主齐性的（principal homogeneous），作用群为<MATH_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"存在的解，待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"分类集合，待决"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解","context":"所有解，待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"解的分类，待决"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的","context":"分类中的作用，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08UK:proof","translation":"立即注意到，给定两个解（solutions）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>，针对（<REF_0001>），由引理<REF_0002>得到一个障碍（obstruction）元素（element）<MATH_0003>，针对映射（map）<MATH_0004>的存在。显然，这个元素（element）是存在同构（isomorphism）的障碍（obstruction），因而区分同构类（isomorphism classes）。因此，为完成证明，只需表明：给定一个解（solution）<MATH_0005>和一个元素（element）<MATH_0006>，可以找到第二个解（solution）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n选择<MATH_0009>，如引理<REF_0003>中对类（class）<MATH_0010>所述。考虑满射（surjection）<MATH_0011>，其核（kernel）为<MATH_0012>，相应的朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）为<MATH_0013>。由该引理，<MATH_0014>是类（class），对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>。将<MATH_0016>替换为<MATH_0017>后，还可假设<MATH_0018>通过一个映射（map）<MATH_0019>分解。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n这些选择确定一个<MATH_0020>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0021>。令<MATH_0022>。注意，<MATH_0023>诱导一个映射（map）<MATH_0024>，且<MATH_0025>是推出（pushout），如下面的图（diagram）<MATH_0026>中所示。令<MATH_0027>为映射（map）<MATH_0028>与复合（composition）<MATH_0029>之和。那么，沿<MATH_0030>的推出（pushout）是另一个环（ring）扩张（extension）<MATH_0031>，填入如上面的一个图（diagram）。计算（略去）表明<MATH_0032>，如所要求。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"algebra map","target_term":"代数映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_ter